        <div style="background-color: rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.1); border-left: 5px solid #FF6B6B; padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
            <h3 style="color: #FF6B6B; margin-top: 0;">Data Fetching Error</h3>
